Glue for U-Boot v2021.01, which predates test/fuzz/, applied by build.sh with
"patch -p1": FUZZ_TEST() and API shims so fit_fuzz.c builds unchanged, a
"fuzz <test> <file>..." replay command, and the rsa3072 table entry upstream
added later (the seed's dev key is RSA-3072). No FIT code under test changes.

--- a/common/image-sig.c
